        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion Nevada Lever with Stepped Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Nevada lever is one of Fusion Hardware's newest additions to their Contemporary Brass line. It is available in 4 finishes. This design is at home in any contemporary scheme. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion Nevada Lever with Stepped Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>”Positive Stop” lever spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Nevada Lever with Stepped Rose Fusion BU-B1:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 4-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass or Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Contemporary Nevada Lever with Stepped Rose, Fusion BU-B1",
                "description": "Fusion BU-B1, Contemporary Nevada Lever with Stepped Rose - The Nevada lever is one of Fusion Hardware's newest additions to their Contemporary Brass line. It is available in 4 finishes. This design is at home in any contemporary scheme. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.\r\n",
